{"commit":"69d69c4","date":"2026-11-16T20:17:36-05:00","branch":"integrate","notes":[{"id":"spot-in-view-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["\"You spot\" now appears only when the place is really on your screen, not when it is behind you, over a hill or behind a rock."]},{"id":"gas-rough-waste-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["Fixed: some worlds with very rough wasteland had no gas station; it now finds the flat ground there."]},{"id":"revive-safe-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["In co-op, a friend you revive now has 3 seconds where nothing can hurt them, with the same glow as a free-for-all respawn."]},{"id":"playlog-gaps-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["Play logs now record more of each co-op game (where your friend was, who was hit and by what), to help find what went wrong."]},{"id":"swallowed-lines-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["Rats squeak again, the stones along the shore are pebbles again, not boulders, and standing on the crashed plane no longer counts as being inside it"]},{"id":"crawler-feet-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["A charging ice crawler's back feet stay planted instead of sliding"]},{"id":"mend-count-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["In a shared game, mending a wall while something is biting it no longer charges the joining player twice"]},{"id":"lurker-spit-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["Bog lurkers now rear up and spit a slow poison glob from a distance: step aside to dodge it","Spitting creatures no longer spit through rocks, walls or a cave's sides"]},{"id":"nametags-near-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Other players' names now show only when they are close by, fade in and out, and hide behind walls and hills (a friend who is down still shows, so you can find them)"]},{"id":"craft-steady-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Fixed: the craft menu no longer jumps around as you move the mouse over it, so you can pick what you want"]},{"id":"threat-ring-sight-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["The red ring under a hunting creature no longer gives it away when you could not see it anyway. In the dark, in thick fog or behind a wall, the ring fades or hides with the creature. Near a fire or a torch, or in daylight, it still shows.","Creatures that are not hunting you no longer have a faint ring under them."]},{"id":"spider-sizes-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["Spiders come in more sizes: most are the size they always were, but about a third are smaller, down to about half size","A small spider has less health and a weaker bite to match"]},{"id":"tutorial-switch-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["The start screen has a \"Show the tutorial\" box under Walk out, so a new player can turn the tour on (or off) before they start. It is the same setting as the one in Settings."]},{"id":"hurt-hunt-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["A bear you keep hitting from range no longer wanders off mid-fight"]},{"id":"stuck-creatures-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["Creatures no longer freeze in one spot on a shore, a dune or a slope while they hunt you","Spider nests now stand well away from towers and other places worth visiting"]},{"id":"barge-hold-nov16","date":"2026-11-16","lines":["The sunken barge's hold is open now: there is a gap in the rim at the back with a ladder down, and a crate waiting at the bottom.","Fixed: you can no longer slip under the barge's deck from the shallows at her bow."]},{"id":"ladder-barge-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Fixed: getting off a ladder. At the top you step off once onto the landing instead of bouncing back onto the rungs, and at the foot you can turn round and walk away. This was worst on the radio tower.","Fixed: you can no longer walk into the ends and corners of the sunken barge's fallen container."]},{"id":"quality-pass-4-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Sandstone pillars, ice spires and giant mushrooms on hillsides now sit on the ground instead of hanging over the slope.","Rats and other creatures no longer appear shut inside a house's walls, and a hound caught indoors finds its way out through the door.","Ice crawlers that wander into deep water now wade back to shore instead of freezing in place.","Swimming over a rock just under the surface now lets you stand on it instead of sinking into the stone."]},{"id":"spider-climb-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Spiders climb now. Up walls, fences and the radio tower they go, belly to the wall and a little slower than they run, so standing on top of something is no longer a safe spot from a spider.","They cannot crawl under an overhang, though: a ledge that sticks out over them stops them. Find a roof with an overhang and they cannot reach you there."]},{"id":"place-fixes-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Fixed: the sunken barge's fallen container no longer hangs in the air over the water, the hermit's rowboat now floats in the lake instead of above it, and a fallen luggage bin in the crashed plane no longer cuts through a row of seats."]},{"id":"plants-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["More plant life everywhere: young trees at the edges of forests, berry bushes you can pick for food, and each land's own shrubs and ground cover, from flowering shrubs, sagebrush and juniper to cattails, puffballs and thorn scrub.","Grass now grows in tall clumps, dry patches and clover, with wildflowers in big patches of one colour."]},{"id":"shelf-food-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Tins, fish tins and salt on shelves and tables can now be taken with E for 1 food each. Once someone takes one, it is gone for everyone, even players who join later."]},{"id":"tracks-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Players, raiders, bears, wolves and spiders now leave tracks: boot prints, paw prints and spider marks that last about a minute in snow, 45 seconds in mud and less on grass and stone."]},{"id":"new-world-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["When everyone falls, playing again starts on a brand-new world. A world you typed the name of stays the same.","Friends who joined follow the host into the new world by themselves: no need to press Join again.","Joining no longer builds a world first and then throws it away, so joining is quicker.","The game now says what happens when you fall: the start menu has a line for each kind of game, the pause screen says it for the game you are in, and the fall screen says why the game ended."]},{"id":"tutorial-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["New players get a short tour the first time they walk out: look, walk, jump, chop, swing and craft, one at a time. It never stops the game, moves on by itself, and can be skipped from the pause screen.","Every button hint now shows the key you press, or a little picture of the controller with the button to press lit up, whichever you used last.","Settings can bring the tour back for a new player on the same computer."]},{"id":"beds-stilt-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Fixed: a bed could stand right across a small bedroom, so you could not get past it to the crate behind. Furniture now always leaves you a way round, and every crate in a house can be reached.","Fixed: the stilt house in the swamp had walls running down into the mud under it, with a low doorway you could never get through. It now stands open on its posts.","Beds and other wide furniture in houses are now solid all the way across, so you no longer sink halfway into them.","Fixed: standing still in the stilt house's front door could drop you through the porch into a fenced-in space under it. The porch now meets the door, and you can walk out from under it on any side."]},{"id":"banner-pause-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["A place's \"Discovered\" name no longer covers the pause screen or the title after a fall."]},{"id":"wolf-calls-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Wolves now give themselves away: a pack watching you gives a low call, a pack coming for you yips as it runs, and at night you hear real packs howl from where they are. Listen for which side the sound comes from."]},{"id":"respawn-safety-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["In free-for-all, a player who comes back after being knocked out is safe from rivals for 4 seconds. A faint blue shimmer shows it, and a rival's hit says SAFE. Attacking ends it early, and creatures can still bite."]},{"id":"lantern-light-nov15","date":"2026-11-15","lines":["Lit lanterns, lamps and stoves inside houses and places now light the room around them at night with a soft, warm glow."]}],"noteIds":["spot-in-view-nov16","gas-rough-waste-nov16","revive-safe-nov16","playlog-gaps-nov16","swallowed-lines-nov16","crawler-feet-nov16","mend-count-nov16","lurker-spit-nov16","nametags-near-nov15","craft-steady-nov15","threat-ring-sight-nov15","spider-sizes-nov16","tutorial-switch-nov16","hurt-hunt-nov16","stuck-creatures-nov16","barge-hold-nov16","ladder-barge-nov15","quality-pass-4-nov15","spider-climb-nov15","place-fixes-nov15","plants-nov15","shelf-food-nov15","tracks-nov15","new-world-nov15","tutorial-nov15","beds-stilt-nov15","banner-pause-nov15","wolf-calls-nov15","respawn-safety-nov15","lantern-light-nov15"],"files":{"index.html":{"size":42987,"sha256":"4390407b50e20e30c0486983988d12cebd1d97e7d9667dc2a1453a28db92641c"},"manifest.webmanifest":{"size":572,"sha256":"4fd9ecc79e7b84fe184382e71d2647002ac121ef04d8561443e11910b8eb4372"},"sw.js":{"size":4918,"sha256":"1cd782efdeafd7e3d9f448ea511ef96acbe1a59a6a3e4daaa80a6e5f63e19eb2"},"src/arrows.js":{"size":3676,"sha256":"4c9a661d73eafdb9bfdfe57ba52aa1df0b76c8003c945fa990550420ba08173d"},"src/audio.js":{"size":31778,"sha256":"d3c3e0576fd8d9b3b5bebcfb766c27ee373f65633280ea313f118412b895890a"},"src/bear.js":{"size":16256,"sha256":"67746b70d7c32ba1ec44145cfd62f53cb5dff9d8979fc28ca908d5bcec290c7c"},"src/bog.js":{"size":5444,"sha256":"0da14324c577a1e17f8109733b42a31538b3c23e1d07f8ae94f2ae5ac61a627b"},"src/build.js":{"size":37783,"sha256":"a3b5220f674174e3eca9ee7d70f11f5bf1eea381227a27bce40beb6346d94f6b"},"src/buildings.js":{"size":295279,"sha2